# Solution structure

Projects (prefix **`Challingo`** → replaced by scaffold copy + token expand):

| Project | Role |
|---------|------|
| `Challingo.Api` | HTTP: controllers, DI, middleware, Swagger |
| `Challingo.Core` | Domain, interfaces, DTOs, service implementations |
| `Challingo.Infrastructure` | EF Core, repositories, migrations |

Register new features in `Challingo.Api/DependencyInjection.cs`.
